{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】油麻地一間便利店凌晨被賊人行劫，無人受傷。</p>\n<p>警員封鎖現場調查。凌晨4時許，一名男子手持硬物，闖入佐敦道9號一間便利店指嚇職員，搶走現金後逃去。事件中無人受傷，警方正追緝疑犯下落。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:18:43.443993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T23:17:33.454621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:17:33.454621+00:00","content_hash":"6126e60a677f828fc153105298a0baf38a777eae22a42abfe2c0d394cd88fe05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}